WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:02:56.677 --> 00:03:02.783
the swonrd of saltandenrs

00:03:32.913 --> 00:03:35.348
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:03:41.655 --> 00:03:43.890
Nothing to it! Pretty cool, right, Majic?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.126
You're overdoing it, Sir Orphen.

00:03:46.126 --> 00:03:48.428
It's "Master!" Didn't I already tell you that?

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.430
I'm sorry, Master.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:53.433
But as much as your old man is paying me,

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.502
| guess I have to teach you.

00:03:55.502 --> 00:03:58.505
But of course, Maijic,
for you to do magic of this level,

00:03:58.505 --> 00:04:00.607
we're talking years into the future.

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:08.648
Isn't this the bottle you were aiming for, Master?

00:04:10.117 --> 00:04:12.953
Oh well, these things happen once in a while.

00:04:12.953 --> 00:04:15.622
There are things like carelessness and slumps.

00:04:16.056 --> 00:04:17.557
Right, Master?

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:19.226
I'm going. It's time for breakfast.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.329
Wait for me, Master!

00:05:03.637 --> 00:05:05.672
So, it's been a year?

00:05:05.906 --> 00:05:08.208
What a long time, Totokanta.

00:05:10.177 --> 00:05:11.578
Whoa! Whoa!

00:05:11.578 --> 00:05:13.880
Geez! What's the matter, Sir?

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.449
Who in world caused this mischief?

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.618
There wasn't a hole here yesterday!

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:27.294
What is this?

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:36.469
So, how about it, Orphen?

00:05:36.469 --> 00:05:39.039
Does my son seem to have any talent?

00:05:39.039 --> 00:05:42.008
Yeah, tons. I'll guarantee it.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:45.011
What an unreliable guarantee.

00:05:45.312 --> 00:05:46.713
What're you saying?

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:49.983
From the Tower of Fangs, a Court Sorcerer,

00:05:49.983 --> 00:05:52.752
1, the black sorcerer, Orphen,
am guaranteeing it!

00:05:53.086 --> 00:05:57.057
That's right. You saw it too, didn't you, Father?
Master's pendant?

00:05:57.557 --> 00:06:01.962
Only black sorcerers from the Tower of Fangs
have that dragon pendent.

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:05.532
I'm not doubting the
"from the Tower of Fangs" part.

00:06:05.532 --> 00:06:10.203
But one of the thirteen candidates
for Court Sorcerer? I can't see it.

00:06:11.071 --> 00:06:15.108
Why would such an amazing sorcerer
hang around Totokanta a whole year?

00:06:15.108 --> 00:06:17.911
Not working, lazing around every day.

00:06:17.911 --> 00:06:20.213
Not to mention the three months of rent
you have yet to pay!

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.748
That's kind of strange, isn't it?

00:06:21.748 --> 00:06:23.783
Old man, didn't you know?

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:26.386
Sorcerers are lazy.

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:27.854
First I've heard of it.

00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:30.423
Really? But I am working.

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:31.258
Right?

00:06:32.893 --> 00:06:34.561
Well, yeah.

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:41.801
It's been two moons since you first
began teaching my son magic,

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:44.704
but there doesn't appear to be any results at all.

00:06:44.704 --> 00:06:46.873
You don't get it at all, do you, old man?

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:50.677
Magic isn't something you learn that easily.

00:06:50.677 --> 00:06:52.279
It's all in the wording, is it?

00:06:52.279 --> 00:06:53.413
Father!

00:06:54.848 --> 00:06:57.918
You! That was the delight of tonight's dinner!

00:06:57.918 --> 00:06:59.886
I'm so sorry, Master!

00:06:59.886 --> 00:07:01.454
Oh, well.

00:07:01.454 --> 00:07:03.690
Heal that which is mine, Spirit of Healing Light.

00:07:11.564 --> 00:07:15.435
Well, anyway, Orphen,
just don't give my son any false hopes.

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:18.038
He's so gullible.

00:07:18.038 --> 00:07:19.539
| understand.

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:26.012
What is it, Majic?

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:28.248
Isn't that dirty?

00:07:32.686 --> 00:07:34.788
Geez! We're going now, Majic!

00:07:42.696 --> 00:07:48.101
Say, Master, what are you doing here everyday?

00:07:48.969 --> 00:07:52.272
It seems like you're looking
towards that mansion all day.

00:07:52.806 --> 00:07:56.609
But isn't that the mansion of the Everlastings?

00:07:57.177 --> 00:08:00.246
| wouldn't know! I'm just bird watching.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.050
Bird watching? You, Master?

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.253
Even though I may not seem like it,
| am a lover of nature.

00:08:10.857 --> 00:08:12.993
Look, Majic, it's a starling!

00:08:15.895 --> 00:08:19.399
What a rare starling. It cries "cuckoo".

00:08:47.627 --> 00:08:49.396
So that's what it is.

00:08:49.396 --> 00:08:50.530
Did you say something?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.098
No, nothing!

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:03.510
What's wrong, Big Sister?

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.945
Nothing, nothing's wrong.

00:09:06.846 --> 00:09:09.382
Really? Then, let's have tea!

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:11.885
| have a lot of souvenir snacks!

00:09:21.694 --> 00:09:24.497
Big Brother, if you keep slacking,
you'll get yelled at again.

00:09:24.731 --> 00:09:26.399
Shut up, Dortin!

00:09:29.169 --> 00:09:34.707
Why am |, the great
Volcan Polkano of Mazmaturia,

00:09:34.707 --> 00:09:38.178
stuck in this place nonchalantly peeling onions?!

00:09:38.178 --> 00:09:40.713
Damn, my eyes sting!

00:09:40.713 --> 00:09:42.182
There's no helping it.

00:09:42.182 --> 00:09:45.151
After all, this is all happening
because of you, Big Brother.

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:47.220
Because you're in debt to that person.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:50.824
That's right! It's THAT person's fault!

00:09:50.824 --> 00:09:54.327
All this, everything, is that
evil, slant-eyed, black sorcerer...

00:09:54.327 --> 00:09:57.564
It's Orphen's fault!

00:09:57.997 --> 00:09:59.833
You shouldn't say things like that.

00:09:59.833 --> 00:10:04.070
After all, he found us this job
so we can pay back our debt faster.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.239
Naive! Naive! Naive!

00:10:06.239 --> 00:10:10.710
Don't you see how he uses us?

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.778
But...

00:10:11.778 --> 00:10:13.446
Remember this, Orphen!

00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:15.381
Someday I'll peel you to death like an onion!

00:10:15.381 --> 00:10:16.683
Yes, and watch your streaming tears as you die...

00:10:16.683 --> 00:10:18.818
Big Brother, after we've finished prepping,
Yes, and watch your streaming tears as you die...

00:10:18.818 --> 00:10:21.621
we still have cleaning to do.
So we better hurry, or...

00:10:22.155 --> 00:10:23.123
Big Brother?

00:10:23.123 --> 00:10:27.227
Wait a minute, I could always
strangle him with an onion ring.

00:10:27.594 --> 00:10:31.898
No, no, death by vegetable stir-fry
is a hard idea to throw out.

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:34.734
Big Brother...

00:11:24.284 --> 00:11:27.754
But why is Orphen so interested in that sword?

00:12:06.526 --> 00:12:09.762
What? You say you've discovered
the Sword of Baltanders?

00:12:09.762 --> 00:12:13.299
Yes, Lai succeeded with his clairvoyance.

00:12:14.167 --> 00:12:16.436
That sword, where is it?

00:12:16.869 --> 00:12:18.404
In Totokanta.

00:12:19.606 --> 00:12:21.241
Totokanta...

00:12:47.367 --> 00:12:50.303
He's just a Peeping Tom, Big Sister!

00:12:50.803 --> 00:12:52.005
Peeping Tom?

00:12:52.005 --> 00:12:55.775
That's right! He's been watching you
this whole time, hasn't he?

00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:59.579
This wasn't what I expected when you said
there was someone you liked.

00:12:59.579 --> 00:13:01.681
He's not that type of person.

00:13:01.681 --> 00:13:05.251
You wouldn't know that, Cleao,
since you've been at school, but...

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.189
How do you know that, Big Sister?

00:13:10.189 --> 00:13:12.692
You don't even know his name,
or where he comes from!

00:13:14.627 --> 00:13:20.199
Because he's watched me for a whole year.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:23.002
Anyone that single-minded can't be a bad person.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:24.771
Big Sister?

00:13:24.771 --> 00:13:27.440
Cleao, you remember something
like that too, don't you?

00:13:32.078 --> 00:13:34.247
No, I don't have a memory like that.

00:13:35.114 --> 00:13:38.985
Anyway, Big Sister, you be careful of
strange people! Understand?

00:13:38.985 --> 00:13:41.354
Hey, Master!

00:13:41.854 --> 00:13:43.122
What is that?

00:13:43.122 --> 00:13:47.593
What do you mean?
They're imperative for bird watching.

00:13:47.593 --> 00:13:49.429
For bird watching?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:54.467
Well, okay. It can't hurt to have them.

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:06.212
Well, it's been awhile since I was home,
so I think I'll go shopping.

00:14:06.479 --> 00:14:11.050
But Big Sister falling in love with
a Peeping Tom of all people!

00:14:38.311 --> 00:14:40.546
|-I wonder what's wrong?

00:14:58.598 --> 00:15:01.334
I'm sorry! Are you alright, Miss?

00:15:01.334 --> 00:15:03.202
It's a Peeping Tom! A Peeping Tom!

00:15:03.202 --> 00:15:05.772
A Peeping Tom was looking into my room!

00:15:06.038 --> 00:15:07.206
A Peeping Tom?

00:15:07.206 --> 00:15:10.076
Oh, if that's all it is,
then you're mistaken. That's-

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.645
| know that person, Miss.

00:15:12.645 --> 00:15:14.647
He's a sorcerer named Orphen,

00:15:14.647 --> 00:15:17.049
and he's known for molesting women
all over the world.

00:15:17.049 --> 00:15:18.951
A total scumbag!

00:15:19.285 --> 00:15:22.255
Molesting women all over the world?

00:15:22.255 --> 00:15:23.956
Unforgivable. Unforgivable!

00:15:23.956 --> 00:15:25.892
Absolutely unforgivable!

00:15:26.159 --> 00:15:28.261
Just a minute, you over there!

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:31.531
You! You! You over there!

00:15:32.498 --> 00:15:36.335
Yes, how dare you peep?!
You dare peep at a virgin's nakedness!

00:15:36.335 --> 00:15:37.570
Nakedness?

00:15:38.604 --> 00:15:41.941
Unforgivable! I won't forgive you,
you enemy of women!

00:15:43.643 --> 00:15:46.712
You know, I'm sorry, but I have
no idea what this is about.

00:15:51.951 --> 00:15:55.121
It's no use for you to play dumb,
you lecherous sorcerer, you!

00:15:56.589 --> 00:15:57.824
You guys.

00:15:57.824 --> 00:16:00.793
What a horrible scoundrel you are
to look upon the nakedness of our lady!

00:16:00.793 --> 00:16:03.796
With this mop, I'll squeak, squeak you to death!

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:05.998
| suspect that's pretty impossible.

00:16:06.199 --> 00:16:09.035
Shut up! This is our chance to
pay him for our everyday grievances.

00:16:09.035 --> 00:16:10.736
You say something too.

00:16:10.736 --> 00:16:12.438
Well...

00:16:12.438 --> 00:16:14.407
Sword of Light, whom I do release.

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:22.081
Magic!

00:16:23.282 --> 00:16:24.784
What did you do?!

00:16:24.784 --> 00:16:26.085
It's all right.

00:16:26.085 --> 00:16:27.820
They're really hardy, you know.

00:16:36.696 --> 00:16:38.364
You're from that time...

00:16:38.364 --> 00:16:39.899
It can't be!

00:16:39.899 --> 00:16:43.302
Of all things for you to be: a Peeping Tom.

00:16:43.469 --> 00:16:46.606
| thought you were mad, but now
all of the sudden you're blue.

00:16:46.606 --> 00:16:48.040
You're an awful busy person.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.209
Are you Cleao?

00:16:50.576 --> 00:16:52.745
Are you back from boarding school?

00:16:53.613 --> 00:16:54.714
Majic?

00:16:55.114 --> 00:16:56.282
Someone you know?

00:16:56.282 --> 00:17:00.152
We went to the same elementary school,
but we were in different grades.

00:17:00.152 --> 00:17:03.155
But, more importantly Master, do you know her?

00:17:03.289 --> 00:17:06.259
No, among my acquaintances there isn't anyone

00:17:06.259 --> 00:17:10.663
who would point a sword at someone
in such an ill-mannered fashion.

00:17:11.397 --> 00:17:13.799
Who did you say was ill-mannered?! Who is?!

00:17:13.799 --> 00:17:17.503
| won't be called that by someone
who peeps at others' nakedness!

00:17:18.738 --> 00:17:22.174
But that I let a man like that
steal my heart even for a moment...

00:17:22.174 --> 00:17:23.576
| feel so ashamed of myself.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:26.746
| guess I don't have an eye for men.

00:17:27.413 --> 00:17:29.415
There's been a misunderstanding.

00:17:29.415 --> 00:17:31.050
| wasn't peeping.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.218
You peeped!

00:17:32.218 --> 00:17:34.253
You peeped! You peeped! You peeped!

00:17:35.054 --> 00:17:37.123
Be honest and admit it!

00:17:37.123 --> 00:17:39.525
Liars don't die a decent death, you know.

00:17:39.525 --> 00:17:41.327
My dead father said so.

00:17:41.661 --> 00:17:43.963
So, I don't think he said to just wave
a sword in front of a person,

00:17:43.963 --> 00:17:45.798
and slice them dead with out
so much as a by-your-leave.

00:17:46.265 --> 00:17:50.469
And also, listen well, I'm telling you
straight up. I wasn't peeping.

00:17:50.469 --> 00:17:52.672
To begin with I don't do things like that.

00:17:52.672 --> 00:17:56.142
And even if I did, I wouldn't peep
at something like that.

00:17:56.142 --> 00:17:58.344
Something like that? Something like what?!

00:17:58.344 --> 00:18:00.212
And what is that in your hand, anyway?!

00:18:00.646 --> 00:18:01.414
Bad...

00:18:01.414 --> 00:18:02.648
Master!

00:18:02.648 --> 00:18:04.884
So you WERE peeping after all!

00:18:05.151 --> 00:18:06.419
Geez!

00:18:07.119 --> 00:18:08.821
Calm down. It was an accident.

00:18:08.821 --> 00:18:11.457
While I was looking around with these,
| just happened to see you.

00:18:11.457 --> 00:18:14.427
It's because Majic brought these with him.

00:18:16.095 --> 00:18:18.364
That's not fair, making it my fault.

00:18:18.364 --> 00:18:20.032
Prepare yourself!

00:18:20.032 --> 00:18:23.536
Even though I may not look like it,
| was on the first string of the Fencing Club!

00:18:26.839 --> 00:18:28.274
That sword is...

00:18:28.541 --> 00:18:29.609
Hey, you!

00:18:38.517 --> 00:18:40.653
Really, you're so squirrelly!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.255
Geez, what a troubled kid!

00:18:52.932 --> 00:18:54.533
A chance!

00:19:07.847 --> 00:19:09.015
Master!

00:19:09.882 --> 00:19:10.716
Majic...

00:19:10.716 --> 00:19:11.450
Yes?

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:14.120
Take her and stay in the mansion.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:16.155
Don't come out at all. Understand?!

00:19:17.423 --> 00:19:20.026
It's okay. Get going. That's an order.

00:19:20.459 --> 00:19:21.560
Right!

00:20:02.735 --> 00:20:03.769
That is...

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:06.338
Is seems that it has come.

00:20:30.062 --> 00:20:31.063
That is...

00:20:31.063 --> 00:20:32.164
What could...

00:20:32.164 --> 00:20:34.600
Bloody August has come!

00:20:34.867 --> 00:20:36.569
Did you say, "Bloody August"?

00:20:37.203 --> 00:20:39.805
What's this "Brassier Orchestra" thing?

00:20:39.805 --> 00:20:41.440
You don't know, Big Brother?

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:45.411
Following tumultuous skies, when the
lightning of darkness strikes the Earth,

00:20:46.045 --> 00:20:51.851
will appear the one steeped in the blood of
August, once again the murders to repeat.

00:20:53.552 --> 00:20:54.987
The lightning of darkness...

00:20:54.987 --> 00:20:59.325
In short, that black lightning
is the warning that it is on its way.

00:20:59.859 --> 00:21:01.961
I've heard of that too.

00:21:01.961 --> 00:21:05.664
Years ago in August,
a monster suddenly appeared,

00:21:05.664 --> 00:21:08.534
destroying cities across the continent.

00:21:08.734 --> 00:21:10.870
What is Master planning to do?

00:21:15.674 --> 00:21:18.110
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:21:23.883 --> 00:21:25.918
Is that Bloody August?

00:21:26.252 --> 00:21:28.053
They're just some ghosts.

00:21:28.053 --> 00:21:30.289
They are the underlings of Bloody August.

00:21:34.894 --> 00:21:36.962
Guide me, O Starling of Death!

00:21:44.703 --> 00:21:45.538
It's here.

00:21:58.017 --> 00:21:59.919
I've waited a year for you!

00:21:59.919 --> 00:22:05.391
No, for the five years since I left the Tower,
I've searched for you...

00:22:05.925 --> 00:22:07.092
Azalie!

00:22:08.994 --> 00:22:13.966
Next orphen

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:17.970
Geez! Why does a monster
have to come to my house?

00:22:18.304 --> 00:22:20.472
Why don't you fight, Orphen?

00:22:20.472 --> 00:22:22.741
What kind of ties do you have to it?

00:22:22.741 --> 00:22:24.710
What is it?

00:22:25.244 --> 00:22:27.046
The Sword of Baltanders?

00:22:27.046 --> 00:22:30.449
Are you saying that Bloody August
has come to take this sword?!

00:22:31.717 --> 00:22:33.819
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:33.819 --> 00:22:35.621
<i>the terror of BLOOJY august
"The Terror of Bloody August."</i>

00:22:35.621 --> 00:22:38.224
<i>The terror of BLOOJY august
Sword of Light, whom I do release!</i>

00:22:38.224 --> 00:22:38.324
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:52.271
You aren't here, the one I really love

00:22:52.271 --> 00:22:56.342
My first love has reached a dead end

00:22:56.809 --> 00:23:05.050
Tonight in my dreams, a smiling you doesn't appear

00:23:05.684 --> 00:23:09.722
Your last lines came out of your lips too soon

00:23:09.722 --> 00:23:13.325
You were troubled by

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:18.197
Your last lines as soon as your lips said them

00:23:18.197 --> 00:23:21.934
But then you kissed me

00:23:23.002 --> 00:23:27.406
To only my lips

00:23:27.406 --> 00:23:31.610
Please give your warmth

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:35.981
To only my lips

00:23:35.981 --> 00:23:39.852
Will you always remain

00:23:40.119 --> 00:23:42.588
A gentle you

00:23:42.588 --> 00:23:46.759
To only my lips

00:23:46.759 --> 00:23:51.063
No matter how hard I try to forget

00:23:51.063 --> 00:23:55.334
To only my lips

00:23:55.334 --> 00:24:01.540
Will you always remain

00:24:01.874 --> 00:24:06.478
The last of you
